Role visibility: All three tabs visible to owner and admin. Artist role: Tab shell is hidden entirely — artist sees only their `PayrollHistorySection` on their own profile (Section 11).

### 3c. Runs tab — `PayrollRunsTab`

```
┌─ PayrollRunsTab ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐
│                                                                               │
│  [Search by label or period…]                           [Status ▾] [Year ▾]  │
│                                                                               │
│  ┌─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐ │
│  │ Period     Status       Artists  Gross        Net          Created       │ │
│  │ ─────────  ──────────   ───────  ───────────  ───────────  ───────────  │ │
│  │ Mar 2026   [calculated]    12    $14,280.00   $12,480.00   Apr 1        │ │
│  │ Feb 2026   [paid]          11    $13,100.00   $11,450.00   Mar 1 · Paid │ │
│  │ Jan 2026   [cancelled]     —         —            —        Feb 1        │ │
│  └─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘ │
└───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘
```

**Table columns:**

| Column | Value | Notes |
|--------|-------|-------|
| Period | `MMM YYYY` from `period_start` | e.g., "Mar 2026" |
| Label | Optional string beneath Period | `text-xs text-muted-foreground` |
| Status | Badge (`badge-payroll-*`) | See token classes |
| Artists | `artist_count` | `tabular-nums`; `—` if cancelled/draft |
| Gross | `formatCurrency(total_gross_cents)` | `tabular-nums` |
| Net | `formatCurrency(total_net_cents)` | `tabular-nums` |
| Created | Relative date | e.g., "Apr 1" |
| Actions | DropdownMenu (3-dot) | Varies by status |

**Row actions per status:**

| Run status | Actions available |
|------------|-------------------|
| `draft` | Calculate, Cancel (owner only) |
| `calculated` | View, Approve (owner only), Recalculate (owner/admin), Cancel (owner only) |
| `approved` | View, Mark Paid (owner only), Cancel (owner only) |
| `paid` | View (read-only) |
| `cancelled` | View (read-only) |

Clicking the row → navigates to `/payroll/runs/[id]`.

"Calculate" and "Approve" in the dropdown trigger a confirmation AlertDialog before executing the RPC.

**Filters:**
- Search: full-text match on `label` field (`text-sm` Input, `placeholder="Search by label or period…"`)
- Status filter: Select (`All / Draft / Calculated / Approved / Paid / Cancelled`)
- Year filter: Select (current year + last 2 years, default current)

Filters are URL search params: `?status=calculated&year=2026`.

