**"Generate 1099-Ks for [year]" CTA:**
- Conditionally rendered: `{isJanuary && canDo('tax_forms.generate')}`.
- Outside January: replace with `<p className="text-xs text-muted-foreground">1099-K forms can only be generated in January.</p>` aligned right.
- Button variant: `default` (filled purple). Only one filled button on this tab.

**Tax year selector:** Select component, options = current year + last 3 years. Drives URL param `?year=2026`. Default: current year.

**Table columns:**

| Column | Value |
|--------|-------|
| Artist | Avatar + display_name |
| Gross | `formatCurrency(gross_amount_cents)`, `tabular-nums` |
| Txn Count | `transaction_count`, `tabular-nums` |
| Threshold | `badge-threshold-met` "Met ✓" OR `badge-threshold-miss` "Below $600" |
| Status | `badge-tax-*` |
| PDF | Download icon button if `pdf_storage_path` set; `<Skeleton>` if generating; `—` if not generated |
| Sent | Date if `sent_at` set; `—` otherwise |
| Actions | DropdownMenu: "Review & Send", "Void", "Issue Correction", "Lock" (conditional per status + locked_at) |

Row click → `/payroll/tax-forms/[id]`.

Artists below threshold are shown in the table (greyed row `opacity-60`) for reference — they have no `tax_forms` row so Status/PDF/Sent show `—`.

