`RunActionsMenu` is a `<DropdownMenu>`. Actions by status:

| Status | Dropdown items |
|--------|---------------|
| `draft` | "Calculate" (owner/admin), Separator, "Cancel Run" (owner, destructive) |
| `calculated` | "Approve Run" (owner only), "Recalculate" (owner/admin), Separator, "Cancel Run" (owner, destructive) |
| `approved` | "Mark Paid" (owner only), Separator, "Cancel Run" (owner, destructive) |
| `paid` | "Export Summary" |
| `cancelled` | (empty — no actions) |

"Cancel Run" always triggers `<AlertDialog>` with: title "Cancel this payroll run?", description "This will unlink all commission records from this run. They'll return to Approved status and can be added to a future run.", destructive confirm button "Cancel Run", secondary "Keep Run".

"Approve Run" triggers `<AlertDialog>`: title "Approve this run?", description "Calculated totals will be locked. Commissions can't be added or removed after this.", confirm "Approve".

"Mark Paid" opens the Mark Paid Modal (Section 6).

