```

**Implementation notes:**

- Summary line at top: `text-sm text-muted-foreground`. Total net: `tabular-nums font-semibold text-foreground`.
- Payment method: `<Select>`. Options: Cash, Check, ACH, Dodo Connect, External, Other. Required.
- Payment reference: `<Input>`, optional, `maxLength={100}`.
- Paid date: `<Popover> + <Calendar>`, default today, max = today.
- Notes: `<Textarea rows={2}`, optional.
- Dodo Connect callout: `bg-muted/30 border border-border p-3 rounded-md flex gap-2`. Shown only when method = `dodo_connect`. Uses `Info` icon `text-muted-foreground`. Text: "We'll trigger Dodo Connect payouts for artists with a linked Dodo account. Artists without a Dodo account will need to be paid manually. (Dodo Connect payouts coming soon.)"
- Lock warning: `.lock-warning` class. `AlertTriangle` icon. Always visible, not conditional.
- "Mark Paid" button: `variant="default"`. Disabled during submission. On submit: calls `mark_payroll_paid` RPC. On success: close modal, refetch run, fire toast `payroll.run.paid`. On error: show inline error below form.
- `DialogFooter`: `flex justify-between` — Cancel left, Mark Paid right.

